---
// BlogCommentsSection.astro
---

<section class="relative 2xl:mb-[100px] 1xl:mb-20 xl:mb-17 lg:mb-14 md:mb-12 sm:mb-11 mb-10 w-full">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="border-t border-primary/25 2xl:pt-[100px] 1xl:pt-20 xl:pt-17 lg:pt-14 md:pt-12 sm:pt-11 pt-10">
      <h5 class="uppercase text-primary mb-6">Leave a Comments</h5>
      <div id="blog-comments" class="sm:space-y-7.5 space-y-6">
        <div data-comment-id="static-1">
          <div class="flex items-center sm:gap-3.5 gap-2.5 lg:mb-5 mb-4">
            <div class="1xl:size-15 xl:size-14 sm:size-13.5 size-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0">
              <img loading="lazy" src="/client-1.webp" alt="Mily R." class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium">Mily R.</p>
              <p class="text-thunder-100/50 text-16">July 25, 2025 at 8:42 AM</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="1xl:pl-18.5 lg:pl-18 sm:pl-17 pl-0">
            <div class="bg-whitesmoke-100 border-l-3 border-primary 1xl:p-8.5 xl:p-7.5 lg:p-6 sm:p-5.5 p-4">
              <p>
                This evening flow routine has completely changed my sleep quality. I now look forward to this calming
                practice every night. Thank you for sharing this!
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center lg:gap-8 sm:gap-6 gap-3 xl:mt-6 lg:mt-4.5 mt-3.5 1xl:pl-6 sm:pl-5 pl-0">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="like-btn flex items-center sm:gap-2 gap-1 cursor-pointer"
                data-like-id="static-1"
                data-base-count="23"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-red-500 lg:size-6 size-5 object-contain" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path fill="currentColor" d="M2 9.137C2 14 6.02 16.591 8.962 18.911C10 19.729 11 20.5 12 20.5s2-.77 3.038-1.59C17.981 16.592 22 14 22 9.138S16.5.825 12 5.501C7.5.825 2 4.274 2 9.137" />
                </svg>
                <p class="p2 text-thunder-100/80">Like</p>
                <span class="like-count text-sm text-thunder-100/80">- 23</span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="reply-btn flex items-center sm:gap-2 gap-1 cursor-pointer"
                data-reply-id="static-1"
                data-reply-to="Mily R."
              >
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-[#575757] lg:size-7 size-6 object-contain" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M14 9V5L21 12L14 19V14.9C9 14.9 5.5 16.5 3 20C4 15 7 10 14 9Z" fill="currentColor" />
                </svg>
                <p class="p2 text-thunder-100/80">Reply</p>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-replies-for="static-1" class="xl:pl-[100px] lg:pl-20 lt:pl-17 xl:space-y-6.5 space-y-5.5"></div>
        </div>
        <div data-comment-id="static-2">
          <div class="flex items-center sm:gap-3.5 gap-2.5 lg:mb-5 mb-4">
            <div class="1xl:size-15 xl:size-14 sm:size-13.5 size-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0">
              <img loading="lazy" src="/client-2.webp" alt="James K." class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium">James K.</p>
              <p class="text-thunder-100/50 text-16">July 27, 2025 at 3:15 PM</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="1xl:pl-18.5 lg:pl-18 sm:pl-17 pl-0">
            <div class="bg-whitesmoke-100 border-l-3 border-primary 1xl:p-8.5 xl:p-7.5 lg:p-6 sm:p-5.5 p-4">
              <p>
                Great tips! I especially liked the focus on breathwork before bedtime. Helped me slow down after a
                long day.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center lg:gap-8 sm:gap-6 gap-3 xl:mt-6 lg:mt-4.5 mt-3.5 1xl:pl-6 sm:pl-5 pl-0">
              <button
                type="button"
                class="like-btn flex items-center sm:gap-2 gap-1 cursor-pointer"
                data-like-id="static-2"
                data-base-count="0"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-[#575757] lg:size-6 size-5 object-contain" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path fill="currentColor" d="M2 9.137C2 14 6.02 16.591 8.962 18.911C10 19.729 11 20.5 12 20.5s2-.77 3.038-1.59C17.981 16.592 22 14 22 9.138S16.5.825 12 5.501C7.5.825 2 4.274 2 9.137" />
                </svg>
                <p class="p2 text-thunder-100/80">Like</p>
                <span class="like-count text-sm text-thunder-100/80"></span>
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="reply-btn flex items-center sm:gap-2 gap-1 cursor-pointer"
                data-reply-id="static-2"
                data-reply-to="James K."
                data-base-reply-count="2"
              >
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="text-[#575757] lg:size-7 size-6 object-contain" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M14 9V5L21 12L14 19V14.9C9 14.9 5.5 16.5 3 20C4 15 7 10 14 9Z" fill="currentColor" />
                </svg>
                <p class="p2 text-thunder-100/80">Reply</p>
                <span class="reply-count text-sm text-thunder-100/80">- 2</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-replies-for="static-2" class="xl:pl-[100px] lg:pl-20 lt:pl-17 xl:space-y-6.5 space-y-5.5">
            <div class="flex items-start sm:flex-row flex-col 1xl:gap-6 lg:gap-4.5 gap-3">
              <div class="flex items-center sm:gap-3.5 gap-2.5 shrink-0">
                <div class="1xl:size-15 xl:size-14 sm:size-13.5 size-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0">
                  <img loading="lazy" src="/client-3.webp" alt="Maya R." class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium">Maya R.</p>
                  <p class="text-thunder-100/50 1xl:text-base lt:text-sm text-13">July 27, 2025 at 3:15 PM</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full sm:flex-1 border border-primary/20 1xl:px-9 xl:px-7 lt:px-6 sm:px-4.5 px-3.5 1xl:py-5.5 xl:py-4.5 sm:py-3.5 py-2.5">
                <p class="text-thunder-100/74">
                  This hip-opening sequence has completely changed my morning routine. I feel lighter, more mobile,
                  and far less stiff throughout the day. Truly grateful for this practice!
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start sm:flex-row flex-col 1xl:gap-6 lg:gap-4.5 gap-3">
              <div class="flex items-center sm:gap-3.5 gap-2.5 shrink-0">
                <div class="1xl:size-15 xl:size-14 sm:size-13.5 size-10 rounded-full overflow-hidden shrink-0">
                  <img loading="lazy" src="/client-4.webp" alt="Lucas M." class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium">Lucas M.</p>
                  <p class="text-thunder-100/50 1xl:text-base lt:text-sm text-13">July 22, 2025 at 10:32 AM</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full sm:flex-1 border border-primary/20 1xl:px-9 xl:px-7 lt:px-6 sm:px-4.5 px-3.5 1xl:py-5.5 xl:py-4.5 sm:py-3.5 py-2.5">
                <p class="text-thunder-100/74">
                  Such a calming and well-guided restorative flow. The supported poses helped my mind slow down
                  instantly. Perfect for unwinding after work!
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="dynamic-blog-comments"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative 2xl:mb-[100px] 1xl:mb-20 xl:mb-17 lg:mb-14 md:mb-12 sm:mb-11 mb-10 w-full">
  <div class="container border-t border-primary/30 2xl:pt-12.5 1xl:pt-11 xl:pt-9 lg:pt-7 sm:pt-6 pt-4">
    <h5 class="uppercase text-primary lg:mb-6 sm:mb-5 mb-4">Leave a Reply</h5>
    <form id="reply-form" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 grid-cols-1 1xl:gap-7.5 md:gap-6 gap-4.5">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start col-span-1">
        <label class="p xl:mb-2.5 mb-1.5" for="reply-first-name">First Name *</label>
        <input id="reply-first-name" type="text" name="firstName" placeholder="Enter Your Name" required class="p placeholder:text-thunder-100/35 text-thunder-100 w-full rounded-full border border-primary/20 md:px-6 px-4 lg:py-3 md:py-2.5 py-2 outline-none focus:border-primary bg-white" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start col-span-1">
        <label class="p xl:mb-2.5 mb-1.5" for="reply-last-name">Last Name *</label>
        <input id="reply-last-name" type="text" name="lastName" placeholder="Enter Your Name" required class="p placeholder:text-thunder-100/35 text-thunder-100 w-full rounded-full border border-primary/20 md:px-6 px-4 lg:py-3 md:py-2.5 py-2 outline-none focus:border-primary bg-white" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:col-span-2 col-span-1">
        <label class="p xl:mb-2.5 mb-1.5" for="reply-email">Email *</label>
        <input id="reply-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter Your Email" required class="p placeholder:text-thunder-100/35 text-thunder-100 w-full rounded-full border border-primary/20 md:px-6 px-4 lg:py-3 md:py-2.5 py-2 outline-none focus:border-primary bg-white" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:col-span-2 col-span-1">
        <label class="p xl:mb-2.5 mb-1.5" for="reply-comment">Comments *</label>
        <textarea id="reply-comment" name="comment" placeholder="Comment" required class="p 1xl:h-[130px] placeholder:text-thunder-100/35 text-thunder-100 w-full rounded-[20px] border border-primary/20 md:px-6 px-4 lg:py-3 py-2 outline-none focus:border-primary bg-white"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start sm:col-span-2 col-span-1">
        <label class="p xl:mb-2.5 mb-1.5" for="reply-image">Image *</label>
        <label class="file-upload relative flex items-center sm:gap-4 gap-2 w-full cursor-pointer p rounded-full border border-primary/20 md:px-6 sm:px-4 px-1.5 lg:py-3 md:py-2.5 sm:py-2 py-1.5 bg-white text-thunder-100">
          <span class="text-primary bg-primary/10 flex items-center sm:text-base text-sm justify-center sm:gap-2.5 gap-1.5 py-[5px] sm:px-4.5 px-3 rounded-full">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="sm:size-6 size-5" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14.2849 17.4886H2.06887V2.48331H11.8744V7.45694C11.8745 7.75408 11.9926 8.03903 12.2027 8.24914C12.4128 8.45925 12.6977 8.57734 12.9949 8.57744H18.6049V13.7569C18.7462 13.7446 18.8899 13.7371 19.0346 13.7371C19.2724 13.7371 19.506 13.7547 19.7347 13.7881V8.31531C19.7347 8.08474 19.6432 7.8636 19.4802 7.70053C19.3172 7.53745 19.0961 7.44579 18.8655 7.44569H13.5105C13.3767 7.44569 13.2484 7.39255 13.1539 7.29796C13.0593 7.20337 13.0061 7.07508 13.0061 6.94131V2.22119C13.0061 2.10699 12.9836 1.9939 12.9399 1.8884C12.8962 1.78289 12.8322 1.68702 12.7514 1.60627C12.6707 1.52552 12.5748 1.46146 12.4693 1.41776C12.3638 1.37406 12.2507 1.35156 12.1365 1.35156H1.41712C1.15238 1.35156 0.9375 1.56644 0.9375 1.83119V18.1407C0.9375 18.4054 1.15238 18.6203 1.41712 18.6203H14.1517C14.1519 18.2391 14.1963 17.8593 14.2849 17.4886Z" fill="currentColor" />
              <path d="M13.6797 6.77284H19.0354L13.6797 2.22559V6.77284Z" fill="currentColor" />
              <path d="M9.91787 9.81231C10.468 9.81231 10.9139 9.36639 10.9139 8.81631C10.9139 8.26624 10.468 7.82031 9.91787 7.82031C9.3678 7.82031 8.92188 8.26624 8.92188 8.81631C8.92188 9.36639 9.3678 9.81231 9.91787 9.81231Z" fill="currentColor" />
              <path d="M15.8366 14.9349L14.2815 12.0092C14.2626 11.9737 14.2364 11.9426 14.2048 11.9179C14.1731 11.8931 14.1367 11.8753 14.0977 11.8655C14.0587 11.8557 14.0181 11.8542 13.9785 11.8611C13.939 11.8679 13.9012 11.883 13.8678 11.9053L11.8271 13.2733C11.79 13.2982 11.7476 13.314 11.7032 13.3196C11.6589 13.3252 11.6139 13.3204 11.5718 13.3056C11.5296 13.2908 11.4915 13.2664 11.4605 13.2343C11.4294 13.2022 11.4063 13.1633 11.3928 13.1207L10.7415 11.0484C10.7295 11.0105 10.7097 10.9754 10.6834 10.9454C10.6572 10.9155 10.6249 10.8913 10.5888 10.8744C10.5527 10.8576 10.5135 10.8484 10.4737 10.8475C10.4339 10.8466 10.3943 10.854 10.3575 10.8692L8.68908 11.5588C8.62853 11.5838 8.56126 11.5874 8.49839 11.569C8.43552 11.5506 8.38081 11.5113 8.34333 11.4576L7.25021 9.88857C7.22106 9.84684 7.18136 9.81358 7.13516 9.79221C7.08896 9.77084 7.03792 9.7621 6.98724 9.76691C6.93657 9.77171 6.88807 9.78988 6.84671 9.81956C6.80536 9.84923 6.77261 9.88935 6.75183 9.93582L4.00908 16.0843C3.98967 16.1281 3.98149 16.176 3.98528 16.2237C3.98906 16.2714 4.0047 16.3174 4.03077 16.3576C4.05684 16.3977 4.09252 16.4307 4.13457 16.4536C4.17662 16.4765 4.22371 16.4885 4.27158 16.4886H14.6422C14.9319 15.8957 15.3381 15.3673 15.8366 14.9349ZM19.035 14.5929C16.8105 14.5929 15.0075 16.3959 15.0075 18.6204C15.0075 20.8446 16.8105 22.6479 19.035 22.6479C21.2591 22.6479 23.0625 20.8446 23.0625 18.6204C23.0625 16.3959 21.2591 14.5929 19.035 14.5929ZM20.9981 18.3936C20.8777 18.5055 20.7178 18.565 20.5535 18.559C20.3892 18.5531 20.234 18.4821 20.1221 18.3617L19.6548 17.8592V20.9597C19.6548 21.1241 19.5895 21.2818 19.4733 21.398C19.357 21.5143 19.1994 21.5796 19.035 21.5796C18.8706 21.5796 18.7129 21.5143 18.5966 21.398C18.4804 21.2818 18.4151 21.1241 18.4151 20.9597V17.8588L17.9478 18.3613C17.8926 18.4212 17.826 18.4696 17.7519 18.5037C17.6779 18.5377 17.5978 18.5568 17.5164 18.5598C17.4349 18.5628 17.3537 18.5497 17.2773 18.5211C17.2009 18.4926 17.131 18.4493 17.0715 18.3936C16.9511 18.2816 16.8801 18.1264 16.8741 17.9622C16.8681 17.7979 16.9277 17.638 17.0396 17.5176L18.5808 15.8593C18.6388 15.7968 18.7091 15.747 18.7872 15.7129C18.8654 15.6788 18.9497 15.6612 19.035 15.6612C19.1202 15.6612 19.2045 15.6788 19.2827 15.7129C19.3608 15.747 19.4311 15.7968 19.4891 15.8593L21.0303 17.5176C21.1422 17.638 21.2017 17.798 21.1956 17.9622C21.1896 18.1265 21.1185 18.2817 20.9981 18.3936Z" fill="currentColor" />
            </svg>
            Browse File
          </span>
          <span class="file-name text-thunder-100 sm:text-sm text-xs">No choosen file</span>
          <input id="reply-image" type="file" name="image" accept="image/*" class="file-input sr-only" required />
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 col-span-1 sm:mt-8.5 mt-7.5 lt:space-y-4 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <input
            id="reply-terms"
            type="checkbox"
            name="condition"
            class="accent-primary cursor-pointer 2xl:size-7 1xl:size-6.5 lg:size-6 sm:size-5 size-4.5 shrink-0"
          />
          <label for="reply-terms" class="p2 cursor-pointer">
            I agree to the terms &amp; conditions and studio policy.
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <input
            id="reply-information"
            type="checkbox"
            name="information"
            class="accent-primary cursor-pointer 2xl:size-7 1xl:size-6.5 lg:size-6 sm:size-5 size-4.5 shrink-0"
          />
          <label for="reply-information" class="p2 cursor-pointer">
            I confirm my information is accurate
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 col-span-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="w-fit btn btn-secondary 2xl:mt-12.5 1xl:mt-11 xl:mt-9 lg:mt-7 sm:mt-6 mt-5"
        >
          Submit
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="cancel-reply hidden w-fit btn bg-transparent border border-primary text-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all"
        >
          Cancel Reply
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="reply-form-status hidden sm:col-span-2 col-span-1" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
